<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Mystical Continent — 오프라인 싱글플레이 에디션 (PC / GitHub Pages)</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com/3.4.17"></script>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    html, body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background-color: #05070e;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      user-select: none;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 100vh;
      width: 100vw;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    html, body {
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      text-rendering: geometricPrecision;
    }
    /* Press Start 2P 폰트에 bold가 적용되면 숫자가 이중으로 겹쳐 보이는 문제를 해결하여 선명한 산세리프/모노 폰트로 통일 */
    .pixel-font {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    canvas.pixel-canvas {
      image-rendering: auto;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 5px;
      height: 5px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: #090d16;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #334155;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="h-screen w-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col bg-[#05070e] text-slate-100">

  <!-- 상단 통합 헤더 바 (고정 높이, 스크롤 없음) -->
  <header class="h-12 shrink-0 border-b border-slate-800/90 bg-slate-900/95 px-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 z-30 shadow-md overflow-x-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Mystical Continent 로고" class="h-9 w-auto object-contain drop-shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(56,189,248,0.45)] shrink-0" />
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
        <span class="pixel-font text-xs sm:text-sm bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-300 via-amber-300 to-yellow-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent whitespace-nowrap">Mystical Continent</span>
        <span class="hidden md:inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 max-w-[230px] xl:max-w-[290px] truncate whitespace-nowrap" id="headerSaveStatus">
          💻 오프라인 자동저장 활성화
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 중앙 빠른 기능 버튼 (시작/상태창, 인벤토리/장비창 모달, 스킬 강화창 모달) -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs shrink-0">
      <button id="btnReturnToStart" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-bold border border-slate-700 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
        🏠 시작/상태창
      </button>
      <button id="btnOpenInventoryModal" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 hover:bg-amber-500 text-amber-300 hover:text-slate-950 font-extrabold border border-amber-500/40 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
        🎒 인벤토리/장비 (I) <span id="navInvBadge" class="ml-1 px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-200 rounded text-[10px]">2</span>
      </button>
      <button id="btnOpenQuestModal" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/20 hover:bg-sky-500 text-sky-300 hover:text-slate-950 font-extrabold border border-sky-500/40 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
        📜 퀘스트 (J) <span id="headerQuestBadge" class="ml-1 px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-sky-500/30 text-sky-200 rounded text-[10px]">Q1/6</span>
      </button>
      <button id="btnOpenSkillModal" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/20 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-emerald-300 hover:text-slate-950 font-extrabold border border-emerald-500/40 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
        ⚡ 스킬 강화 (P) <span id="headerSpBadge" class="ml-1 px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-200 rounded text-[10px]">1 SP</span>
      </button>
      <button id="btnManualSaveHeader" type="button" class="hidden lg:inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600/25 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-indigo-300 hover:text-white font-bold border border-indigo-500/40 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0" title="현재 진행도를 브라우저 및 연결된 로컬 파일에 즉시 저장합니다">
        💾 서버 저장
      </button>
      <button id="btnExportSaveHeader" type="button" class="hidden xl:inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-teal-600/25 hover:bg-teal-600 text-teal-300 hover:text-white font-extrabold border border-teal-500/40 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0" title="현재 모든 캐릭터 슬롯과 진행도를 .json 파일로 내 컴퓨터에 다운로드합니다">
        📥 파일 저장(.json)
      </button>
      <button id="btnImportSaveHeader" type="button" class="hidden xl:inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-purple-600/25 hover:bg-purple-600 text-purple-300 hover:text-white font-extrabold border border-purple-500/40 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0" title="내 컴퓨터에 저장된 .json 세이브 파일(라즈베리 파이 세이브 호환)을 불러옵니다">
        📤 파일 불러오기
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- 우측: 오프라인 1P 상태 / 선택적 서버 연결 및 효과음 토글 -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-[11px] shrink-0">
        <span id="wsStatusDot" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shrink-0"></span>
        <span id="wsStatusText" class="text-slate-300 font-medium hidden sm:inline whitespace-nowrap">오프라인 1P</span>
        <input id="wsUrlInput" type="text" value="ws://127.0.0.1:8765/ws/client" aria-label="Raspberry Pi 4 WebSocket 주소"
          class="hidden 2xl:inline-block bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-200 w-28 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500" />
        <button id="btnConnectWs" type="button" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-slate-200 hover:text-white text-[10px] font-semibold transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
          서버 연결
        </button>
      </div>
      <button id="btnToggleAudio" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[11px] font-semibold border border-slate-700 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
        🔊 효과음 ON
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 메인 뷰포트 영역 (스크롤 없이 한 화면에 꽉 차는 구조) -->
  <main class="flex-1 min-h-0 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto p-2 flex flex-col overflow-hidden">

    <!-- ======================= [화면 1] 시작 / 현재 플레이어 상태 창 / 클래스 선택 (한 눈에 들어오는 무스크롤 레이아웃) ======================= -->
    <section id="viewStart" class="flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2.5 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-3.5 sm:p-4 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">

      <!-- 상단 배너 & 로고 + 오프라인 영구 파일 세이브 관리 + 게임 시작 버튼 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-2.5 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2.5 shrink-0">
        <!-- 좌측: Mystical Continent 판타지 로고 + 타이틀 & 저장 상태 배지 -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Mystical Continent" class="h-12 sm:h-14 w-auto object-contain drop-shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(56,189,248,0.45)] shrink-0" />
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-semibold bg-sky-500/15 text-sky-300 border border-sky-500/30 whitespace-nowrap">
                💻 오프라인 싱글플레이 (서버·ESP32 불필요)
              </span>
              <span id="startSaveTimeBadge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 max-w-[280px] sm:max-w-[340px] truncate whitespace-nowrap">
                💾 로컬 자동저장: 준비됨
              </span>
              <span id="localFileSyncBadge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-semibold bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 max-w-[260px] sm:max-w-[320px] truncate whitespace-nowrap">
                📁 영구 파일(.json) 백업 지원
              </span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-white mt-1 truncate">
              Mystical Continent <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-400">— 신비의 대륙 오프라인 싱글플레이 RPG</span>
            </h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 우측: 1열(캐릭터 생성/삭제 + 게임 시작 메인 버튼) & 2열(영구 세이브 파일 저장/불러오기/자동연동) -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-stretch sm:items-end gap-1.5 shrink-0">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-1.5">
            <button id="btnOpenCreateCharModal" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs shadow transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
              ➕ 새 캐릭터 생성
            </button>
            <button id="btnDeleteCharSlot" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-rose-900/70 hover:bg-rose-600 text-rose-200 hover:text-white font-bold text-xs border border-rose-500/40 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
              🗑️ 캐릭터 삭제
            </button>
            <button id="btnStartAdventure" type="button" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-rose-600 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-rose-500 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-lg shadow-rose-600/30 transition flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
              <span>▶ 선택한 캐릭터로 게임 시작</span>
            </button>
            <button id="btnResetProgress" type="button" class="hidden px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-rose-900/70 text-slate-300 hover:text-rose-200 font-bold text-xs border border-slate-700 transition whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
              🔄 진행도 초기화 (새 게임)
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-1.5">
            <input id="inputImportSaveFile" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" class="hidden" />
            <button id="btnExportSaveStart" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-teal-600/90 hover:bg-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-[11px] shadow transition flex items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0" title="내 컴퓨터의 원하는 폴더에 영구 세이브 파일(.json)로 다운로드합니다">
              <span>📥 세이브 파일 저장 (.json)</span>
            </button>
            <button id="btnImportSaveStart" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-purple-600/90 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white font-extrabold text-[11px] shadow transition flex items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0" title="컴퓨터에 보관해 둔 .json 세이브 파일(라즈베리 파이 세이브 파일 포함)을 불러옵니다">
              <span>📤 세이브 파일 불러오기</span>
            </button>
            <button id="btnLinkLocalSaveFile" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600/80 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-[11px] border border-indigo-400/40 shadow transition flex items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0" title="크롬/엣지에서 내 컴퓨터의 .json 파일을 지정하면 플레이 중 자동 저장될 때마다 해당 파일에 실시간으로 덮어씁니다">
              <span>📁 내 컴퓨터 파일 자동연동</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 중앙: 현재 플레이어 상태 창 (레벨 + 착용 장비 + 스탯 + 소유 아이템) -->
      <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 bg-slate-950 border-2 border-indigo-500/60 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-1.5 shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-400">📊 현재 플레이어 상태 창 (Mystical Continent 오프라인 자동저장 + .json 영구 파일 호환)</span>
            <span id="selectedGameBadge" class="text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-indigo-500/30">
              1P 이어하기 연동
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px]">
            <span class="text-slate-400">저장 위치:</span>
            <strong id="statusZoneName" class="text-emerald-300">🌲 에메랄드 숲</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-600">|</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">몬스터 처치:</span>
            <strong id="statusKills" class="text-amber-300">0마리</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-3 pt-2 items-stretch overflow-hidden">
          <!-- 1) 캐릭터 프리뷰 + 해당 창 내부 생성 캐릭터 목록 + 재화 (4 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border-2 border-sky-400/60 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                <canvas id="statusPreviewCanvas" width="128" height="128" class="pixel-canvas w-14 h-14"></canvas>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span id="statusLevelBadge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40 font-extrabold text-xs pixel-font">Lv.1</span>
                  <span id="statusCharName" class="text-sm font-extrabold text-sky-300 truncate">에이든</span>
                  <span id="statusGenderBadge" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300 border border-sky-500/30 text-[10px] font-bold">♂ 남성</span>
                  <span id="statusClassTitle" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 truncate">가디언 나이트</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-1.5">
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-0.5">
                    <span>EXP</span>
                    <span id="statusExpLabel" class="font-mono text-amber-300">0 / 100</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="w-full h-2 bg-slate-950 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-slate-800">
                    <div id="statusExpBar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-yellow-300" style="width: 0%"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 생성한 캐릭터 목록 (해당 창 내부에 나열) -->
            <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-2 overflow-hidden">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5 shrink-0">
                <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-sky-400">👥 생성한 캐릭터 목록 (클릭하여 선택)</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">생성 후 직업 변경 불가</span>
              </div>
              <div id="charSlotsContainer" class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto space-y-1.5 pr-1"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs shrink-0">
              <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">💰 골드</span>
                <strong id="statusGoldText" class="text-amber-400 font-mono">50G</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">✨ SP</span>
                <strong id="statusSpText" class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">1 SP</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 2) 현재 합산 스탯 (4 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-start gap-2.5">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">
              ⚔️ 현재 능력치 (기본 + 착용 장비 합산)
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-xs">
              <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">❤️ 체력</div>
                <div id="statusStatHp" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-rose-400 font-mono mt-0.5">240/240</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">💧 마나</div>
                <div id="statusStatMp" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-sky-400 font-mono mt-0.5">90/90</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">🗡️ 공격력</div>
                <div id="statusStatAtk" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-300 font-mono mt-0.5">30</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">🛡️ 방어력</div>
                <div id="statusStatDef" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-indigo-300 font-mono mt-0.5">14</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">👟 속도</div>
                <div id="statusStatSpd" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-emerald-300 font-mono mt-0.5">205</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">💥 치명타</div>
                <div id="statusStatCrit" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-purple-300 font-mono mt-0.5">18%</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3) 착용 장비 & 소유 아이템 빠른 장착 (4 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="space-y-1 text-[11px]">
              <div class="font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400 mb-1">🛡️ 착용 장비 & 소유 아이템</div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-slate-800 flex justify-between">
                <span class="text-slate-400">🗡️ 무기:</span>
                <strong id="statusEquipWeapon" class="text-amber-300 truncate max-w-[180px]">장착 없음</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-slate-800 flex justify-between">
                <span class="text-slate-400">🛡️ 방어구:</span>
                <strong id="statusEquipArmor" class="text-sky-300 truncate max-w-[180px]">장착 없음</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-slate-800 flex justify-between">
                <span class="text-slate-400">💍 장신구:</span>
